      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are carrying an immense weight, feeling unseen and like a relic that no longer belongs in the modern landscape. The idea of things ending gracefully can feel appealing when the present feels so unbearable. If you are feeling that your era is over, please know that your life and your presence matter deeply to someone, even if you cannot feel it right now. Reaching out for support can help you find a new way to inhabit your space, rather than just existing in the corner.",
      "source": "target",
